## pingpong
这里fork之后，父子进程就有了相同的管道的文件描述符。

父进程先写入字符，然后等待子进程处理后接收传回来的字符。
```c
#include "kernel/stat.h"
#include "user/user.h"

int main(int argc, char *argv[])
{
    char buf[1];
    int n;
    int status;
    int fds[2];
    pipe(fds);

    int pid = fork();
    if (pid == 0) {
        n = read(fds[0], buf, sizeof(buf));
        printf("%d: received ping\n", getpid());
        write(fds[1], buf, n);
    } else {
        write(fds[1], "p", 1);
        wait(&status);
        n = read(fds[0], buf, sizeof(buf));
        printf("%d: received pong\n", getpid());
    }

    exit(0);
}
```

